WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:03.628
Things will happen to you…

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:06.589
… things that you cannot control.

00:00:07.799 --> 00:00:09.592
A raw emotion will find you…

00:00:11.386 --> 00:00:12.220
… when it does…

00:00:13.555 --> 00:00:16.558
… what you do will define who you are.

00:00:19.936 --> 00:00:21.521
Our heroes reunite.

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:22.188
Hey!

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:22.856
Oh my god.

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:23.398
Hi!

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:23.898
Are you okay?

00:00:23.898 --> 00:00:24.566
Oh, yes!

00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:27.527
I wanna do something that matters.

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:42.625
What the hell happened to my face!?

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:44.085
Welcome back.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.423
I’m gonna compete with you, buddy!

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:49.507
Buddy?

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:53.887
They’re worried you can predict the future.

00:00:54.137 --> 00:00:56.389
They’re worried people believe I can.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:00:59.225
My name is Jon Stewart!

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:00.852
Welcome to The…

00:01:00.852 --> 00:01:03.855
… Problem with Jon Stewart—we should put a comma in that.

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:07.484
The world wants to test us…

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:10.028
… to see if it can break us.

00:01:13.698 --> 00:01:14.908
He didn’t beat you because he’s better…

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:16.493
… he beat you because he’s smarter.

00:01:18.161 --> 00:01:19.204
Do you think we’ll make it?

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:24.667
Not without my team.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.463
I think I can help you…

00:01:28.463 --> 00:01:32.175
… but first thing I’m gonna do is completely unethical. I’m gonna give you a hug.

00:01:32.967 --> 00:01:33.843
I’m a hugger.

00:01:34.302 --> 00:01:36.304
Hey. Remember to focus on the here and now.

00:01:36.304 --> 00:01:39.307
Living in the moment is a gift, that’s why they call it the present, y’all!

